WEBVTT

00:04:59.837 --> 00:05:01.839
There are so many
different types of games.

00:05:01.881 --> 00:05:04.508
Battle games, strategy games,

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:08.220
football games -- soccer --
or racing games.

00:05:08.763 --> 00:05:12.308
The reason why I like racing
so much, it's unique.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:18.356
It is the only digital sport
that represents the real world so much.

00:05:18.397 --> 00:05:22.485
It is almost an exact twin
of the physical world.

00:05:23.652 --> 00:05:25.529
As part of my day job,

00:05:25.529 --> 00:05:28.074
I work with organizations
around the world.

00:05:28.074 --> 00:05:30.659
I work for a software company
specialized in data.